# Todo

Add, remove, toggle, filter (all / active / done), a live count, persisted across reloads.

## Note

`Save todos as "todos".` writes the whole list after every change, and
`Load "todos" into todos.` reads it back when the page loads: a `Seq` of `Todo`
records round-trips through the JSON codec derived from the record type, so the
page carries no encoder of its own. A visitor who has never saved anything loads
the empty list the field started with.

The filter is a derived list. `Let visible always be visibleTodos(todos, filter).`
is recomputed whenever `todos` or `filter` changes, and the view loops over it,
`keyed by t's id`, with an `{else:}` arm for a filter nothing matches.

## A Todo has:
    an id, which is Int.
    a text, which is Text.
    a done, which is Bool.

## To nextIdFor (todos: Seq of Todo) -> Int:
    Let mutable highest be 0.
    Repeat for t in todos:
        If t's id is greater than highest:
            Set highest to t's id.
    Return highest + 1.

## To openCount (todos: Seq of Todo) -> Int:
    Let mutable n be 0.
    Repeat for t in todos:
        If t's done is equal to false:
            Set n to n + 1.
    Return n.

## To isVisible (t: Todo) and (filter: Text) -> Bool:
    If filter is equal to "active":
        Return t's done is equal to false.
    If filter is equal to "done":
        Return t's done is equal to true.
    Return true.

## To visibleTodos (todos: Seq of Todo) and (filter: Text) -> Seq of Todo:
    Let mutable shown be a new Seq of Todo.
    Repeat for t in todos:
        If isVisible(t, filter):
            Push t to shown.
    Return shown.

## Page /

State:
    Let todos be a new Seq of Todo.
    Let draft be "".
    Let nextId be 1.
    Let filter be "all".
    Let left always be openCount(todos).
    Let visible always be visibleTodos(todos, filter).

Actions:
    When the page loads:
        Load "todos" into todos.
        Set nextId to nextIdFor(todos).

    To add:
        If draft is equal to "":
            Return.
        Push (a new Todo with id nextId and text draft and done false) to todos.
        Set nextId to nextId + 1.
        Set draft to "".
        Save todos as "todos".

    To toggle (id: Int):
        Let mutable next be a new Seq of Todo.
        Repeat for t in todos:
            If t's id is equal to id:
                Push (a new Todo with id t's id and text t's text and done (not t's done)) to next.
            Otherwise:
                Push t to next.
        Set todos to next.
        Save todos as "todos".

    To remove (id: Int):
        Let mutable kept be a new Seq of Todo.
        Repeat for t in todos:
            If t's id is not equal to id:
                Push t to kept.
        Set todos to kept.
        Save todos as "todos".

    To showAll:
        Set filter to "all".

    To showActive:
        Set filter to "active".

    To showDone:
        Set filter to "done".

View:
    <main class="todo card">
      <h1>Todo</h1>
      <form id="add-form" on-submit.prevent={add}>
        <label for="draft">What needs doing?</label>
        <input id="draft" type="text" bind={draft} placeholder="What needs doing?">
        <button type="submit">Add</button>
      </form>
      <ul>
        {for each t in visible, keyed by t's id:}
          <li class="todo-row" class:done={t's done}>
            <button id="toggle-{t's id}" class="toggle" on-click={toggle(t's id)}>{t's text}</button>
            <button id="remove-{t's id}" class="remove" on-click={remove(t's id)}>remove</button>
          </li>
        {else:}
          <li class="empty">Nothing to do.</li>
        {end}
      </ul>
      <p id="left">{left} left</p>
      <nav class="filters">
        <button id="filter-all" class:active={filter is equal to "all"} on-click={showAll}>all</button>
        <button id="filter-active" class:active={filter is equal to "active"} on-click={showActive}>active</button>
        <button id="filter-done" class:active={filter is equal to "done"} on-click={showDone}>done</button>
      </nav>
    </main>

Style:
    .todo { max-width: 28rem; margin: 3rem auto; }
    .todo-row.done .toggle { text-decoration: line-through; color: var(--muted); }
    .filters button.active { font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline; }

## Test: the empty list shows its placeholder and a zero count

Expect that the text of ".empty" is equal to "Nothing to do.".
Expect that the text of "#left" is equal to "0 left".

## Test: adding builds the list and counts what is left

Type "milk" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Type "bread" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 2.
Expect that the text of "#left" is equal to "2 left".
Expect that the value of "#draft" is equal to "".

## Test: an empty draft adds nothing

Submit "#add-form".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 0.

## Test: toggling strikes a row and moves the count

Type "milk" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Type "bread" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Click "#toggle-1".
Expect that the count of ".done" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "#left" is equal to "1 left".
Click "#toggle-1".
Expect that the count of ".done" is equal to 0.
Expect that the text of "#left" is equal to "2 left".

## Test: removing drops exactly that row

Type "milk" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Type "bread" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Click "#remove-1".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "#toggle-2" is equal to "bread".

## Test: the filters narrow the visible rows without losing the others

Type "milk" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Type "bread" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Click "#toggle-1".
Click "#filter-active".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "#toggle-2" is equal to "bread".
Click "#filter-done".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "#toggle-1" is equal to "milk".
Click "#filter-all".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 2.

## Test: a filter nothing matches shows the placeholder, and follows new items

Type "milk" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Click "#filter-done".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 0.
Expect that the text of ".empty" is equal to "Nothing to do.".
Expect that the text of "#left" is equal to "1 left".
Type "bread" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 0.
Click "#filter-active".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 2.
Expect that the count of ".empty" is equal to 0.

## Test: the list survives a reload

Type "milk" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Click "#toggle-1".
Reload the page.
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 1.
Expect that the count of ".done" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "#toggle-1" is equal to "milk".

## Test: removing after a reload still persists

Type "milk" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Type "bread" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Reload the page.
Click "#remove-1".
Reload the page.
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 1.
Expect that the text of "#toggle-2" is equal to "bread".

## Test: an item added after a reload takes the next free id

Type "milk" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Type "bread" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Reload the page.
Type "eggs" into "#draft".
Submit "#add-form".
Expect that the count of ".todo-row" is equal to 3.
Expect that the text of "#toggle-3" is equal to "eggs".
Expect that the text of "#left" is equal to "3 left".
